    "annotations": {
      "description": "device-mapper reports the pool as out_of_data_space, read-only, needs_check or failed. Tenant writes on every thin volume of this node fail now. Check dmsetup status and the kernel log on the node, keep every volume, and move instances off the node through the planned migration path. Do not run thin_check or lvconvert --repair against an active pool.",
      "runbook_url": "https://github.com/tuist/tuist/blob/main/infra/helm/k8s-monitoring/alerts.md#kura-thin-pool-read-only-or-out-of-data-space",
